    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"StartAbsoluteValue p EndAbsoluteValue plus 61 equals 65\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>p</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>61</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which value is a solution to the given equation?</p>",
