    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 76\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>76</mn>\n</mrow></math><br /><math alttext=\"y equals x squared minus 5\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p>The graphs of the given equations in the <em>xy</em>-plane intersect at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. What is a possible value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>?</p>",
