    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"left parenthesis x plus 2 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 5 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 9 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is a positive solution to the given equation?</p>",
