    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The solution to the system corresponds to the point where the graphs of the equations intersect. The graphs of the linear equation and the quadratic equation shown intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is the solution to this system.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>",
