    "stem": "<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">In a city, the property tax <span class=\"italic\">T</span>, in dollars, is calculated using the formula above, where <span class=\"italic\">P</span> is the value of the property, in dollars. Which of the following expresses the value of the property in terms of the property tax?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "D",
