        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"n equals StartFraction 16 Over p minus 20 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>n</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mn>16</mn>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>20</mn>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>"
