    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"3 x left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 5 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is one of the solutions to the given equation?</p>",
