    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"StartFraction 14 x Over 7 y EndFraction equals 2 StartRoot w plus 19 EndRoot\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></msqrt></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The given equation relates the distinct positive real numbers <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi></math>, <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>, and <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>. Which equation correctly expresses <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi></math> in terms of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>?</p>",
