    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"minus x squared plus b x minus 676 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>676</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p>In the given equation, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> is a positive integer. The equation has no real solution. What is the greatest possible value of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math>?</p>",
