        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"five fourths plus StartFraction StartRoot 105 EndRoot Over 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>+</mo><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<msqrt>\n\t\t\t<mn>105</mn>\n\t\t</msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> </p>"
