        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"5 x squared minus 14 x minus 49 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>14</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>49</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow></math></p>"
