    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x squared minus 40 x minus 10 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>40</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>10</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the sum of the solutions to the given equation?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
